Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 23:58:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 21/24] oplus-fwk: add the Oplus access-control manager surface
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Provide the OEM access-control (app privacy) plumbing:

  * IOplusAccessControlManager binder interface.
  * sepolicy: let system_server register the access-control services,
    label the Oplus app-privacy services, and add the service types to
    the 202404 compat ignore list.

Change-Id: I9386a3959f94fc3abf0afbe24d1641a3b22b058e
(cherry picked from commit 2b36a8ede32a6b3867281d9570ebfaa02d8c00f5)

Ledger: hardware_oplus.md Accepted Group C row 10 (2b36a8ed)
Stub-matrix: task-9-stub-inventory.md row K06 — consumers: OppoGallery2+VideoGallery (IOplusAccessControlObserver/OplusAccessControlInfo, dex-scan); system_server registers the services (build-dep); location: oplus-fwk boot jar + sepolicy/qti service.te/service_contexts/202404.ignore.cil
